OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FMostly cloudy in the east with
OL,6,Fthe best of the brightness in the
OL,7,Fwest. A few scattered showers
OL,8,Fdeveloping from lunchtime, perhaps
OL,9,Fturning to more persistent rain in the
OL,10,Ffar south through late afternoon.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FRain will gradually spread
OL,13,Fnorth through the evening and
OL,14,Fovernight, heaviest and most
OL,15,Fpersistent in the east. Occasionally
OL,16,Fbreezy around the North Sea coast.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
