OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FCloudy. Persistent and heavy
OL,6,Frain in the east will gradually ease
OL,7,Fthrough the afternoon and evening.
OL,8,FSome rain in the southwest at first,
OL,9,Fbecoming dry by afternoon. Breezy
OL,10,Faround coasts.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FFurther
OL,13,Frain or showers at times, occasionally
OL,14,Fheavy, with some drier and brighter
OL,15,Fspells. Winds will be mostly light but
OL,16,Flikely freshening on Monday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
